<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Crendell in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Crendell in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crendell Investment Corp Ltd said on Friday talks regarding further acquisitions were taking place and shareholders should continue to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
